{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 4, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  x86-64          -march=x86-64          baseline x86-64 (SSE2): sse2\n  x86-64-v2       -march=x86-64-v2       SSE4.2, POPCNT: sse2 sse3 ssse3 sse4.1 sse4.2 popcnt\n  x86-64-v3       -march=x86-64-v3       AVX2, BMI1/2, FMA, LZCNT: sse2 sse3 ssse3 sse4.1 sse4.2 popcnt lzcnt bmi bmi2 avx avx2 fma movbe\n  x86-64-v4       -march=x86-64-v4       AVX-512 F/BW/DQ/VL: sse2 sse3 ssse3 sse4.1 sse4.2 popcnt lzcnt bmi bmi2 avx avx2 fma avx512f avx512bw avx512dq avx512vl movbe\n  skylake         -march=skylake         Intel Skylake / Coffee Lake client: sse2 sse3 ssse3 sse4.1 sse4.2 popcnt lzcnt bmi bmi2 avx avx2 fma pclmul aes movbe\n  skylake-avx512  -march=skylake-avx512  Intel Skylake-SP/X: sse2 sse3 ssse3 sse4.1 sse4.2 popcnt lzcnt bmi bmi2 avx avx2 fma avx512f avx512bw avx512dq avx512vl pclmul aes movbe\n  icelake         -march=icelake-client  Intel Ice Lake client: sse2 sse3 ssse3 sse4.1 sse4.2 popcnt lzcnt bmi bmi2 avx avx2 fma avx512f avx512bw avx512dq avx512vl avx512vbmi avx512vpopcntdq gfni pclmul aes movbe\n  alderlake       -march=alderlake       Intel Alder Lake / Raptor Lake P-core (Golden Cove): sse2 sse3 ssse3 sse4.1 sse4.2 popcnt lzcnt bmi bmi2 avx avx2 fma gfni pclmul aes movbe\n  raptorlake      -march=raptorlake      Intel Raptor Lake P-core: sse2 sse3 ssse3 sse4.1 sse4.2 popcnt lzcnt bmi bmi2 avx avx2 fma gfni pclmul aes movbe\n  sapphirerapids  -march=sapphirerapids  Intel Sapphire Rapids (Golden Cove): sse2 sse3 ssse3 sse4.1 sse4.2 popcnt lzcnt bmi bmi2 avx avx2 fma avx512f avx512bw avx512dq avx512vl avx512vbmi avx512vpopcntdq gfni pclmul aes movbe\n  zen3            -march=znver3          AMD Zen 3: sse2 sse3 ssse3 sse4.1 sse4.2 popcnt lzcnt bmi bmi2 avx avx2 fma pclmul aes movbe\n  zen4            -march=znver4          AMD Zen 4: sse2 sse3 ssse3 sse4.1 sse4.2 popcnt lzcnt bmi bmi2 avx avx2 fma avx512f avx512bw avx512dq avx512vl avx512vbmi avx512vpopcntdq gfni pclmul aes mo